    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Zen White</strong> is a 2D puzzle platformer where the world flips every 10 seconds between two versions \u2014 black and white \u2014 each with different platforms, walls, and possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your mind, your timing, and help from unusual seal-shaped inhabitants to solve puzzles, unlock time-bending abilities, and reach the exit. Every level is a moment of calm \u2014 and cleverness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf13 <strong>Two colors. One path.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jump, wait, land. What exists in black may vanish in white...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/12541223a96e21ae4940bd57da4701d4.poster.avif?t=1749132807\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/12541223a96e21ae4940bd57da4701d4.webm?t=1749132807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/12541223a96e21ae4940bd57da4701d4.mp4?t=1749132807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>One puzzle. Many helpers.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Push friendly seals into place. Stack them, slide them, or give them a nudge \u2014 sometimes they help...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/7f468bc9af7745490088c6169dee5a90.poster.avif?t=1749132807\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/7f468bc9af7745490088c6169dee5a90.webm?t=1749132807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/7f468bc9af7745490088c6169dee5a90.mp4?t=1749132807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>One wall. Two realities.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Walk through what\u2019s solid\u2026 or wait for it to disappear.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/c6a315630976556d541dc16ffb20b582.poster.avif?t=1749132807\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/c6a315630976556d541dc16ffb20b582.webm?t=1749132807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/c6a315630976556d541dc16ffb20b582.mp4?t=1749132807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\uddd8 <strong>Stay calm. Solve smart.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Zoom out, think through layers of shifting logic \u2014 black, then white, then black...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/1175e385962e4a4cec3ba933cf251bf4.poster.avif?t=1749132807\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/1175e385962e4a4cec3ba933cf251bf4.webm?t=1749132807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/1175e385962e4a4cec3ba933cf251bf4.mp4?t=1749132807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf00 <strong>Patience is power. Bending time is power.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Slow down. Speed up. Master time itself to reach what was once unreachable.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/8cd4ccde28d1b768c53656fd1dab6643.poster.avif?t=1749132807\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/8cd4ccde28d1b768c53656fd1dab6643.webm?t=1749132807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/8cd4ccde28d1b768c53656fd1dab6643.mp4?t=1749132807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfc1 The end is always there. The path is always changing.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>There\u2019s always a way \u2014 if you wait, watch, and move with purpose.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/6a25308ea4f715642e1c827df04fe68e.poster.avif?t=1749132807\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/6a25308ea4f715642e1c827df04fe68e.webm?t=1749132807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/6a25308ea4f715642e1c827df04fe68e.mp4?t=1749132807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Zen White</strong> invites you into a meditative world of duality, lighthearted logic, and surprising discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd8b\ufe0f Wishlist now and discover the power of stillness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Zen White</strong> is a 2D puzzle platformer where the world flips every 10 seconds between two versions \u2014 black and white \u2014 each with different platforms, walls, and possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your mind, your timing, and help from unusual seal-shaped inhabitants to solve puzzles, unlock time-bending abilities, and reach the exit. Every level is a moment of calm \u2014 and cleverness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf13 <strong>Two colors. One path.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jump, wait, land. What exists in black may vanish in white...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/12541223a96e21ae4940bd57da4701d4.poster.avif?t=1749132807\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/12541223a96e21ae4940bd57da4701d4.webm?t=1749132807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/12541223a96e21ae4940bd57da4701d4.mp4?t=1749132807\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>One puzzle. Many helpers.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Push friendly seals into place. Stack them, slide them, or give them a nudge \u2014 sometimes they help...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/7f468bc9af7745490088c6169dee5a90.poster.avif?t=1749132807\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237030/extras/7f468bc9af7745490088c6169dee5a90.webm?t=1749132807\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp